      <CodeBlock code={"alias dogsbay-xml='java -cp /opt/dogsbay-editor-all.jar com.dogsbay.dogsbayaieditor.cli.DogsBayCli'\ndogsbay-xml validate-deliverables ."} lang="bash" />
      <p>All commands in <a href="/dogsbay-xml-docs/reference/cli">the command line reference</a> work this way, except commands that control a running editor.</p>
